SA-SCL: Social Network User Agents with Time-Aware Stochastic Competitive Learning
A framework integrating LLMs with time-aware stochastic competitive learning for controllable social simulation.

Features
Style Cloning: Reads user posting history from X/Twitter and Weibo (via account ID or uploaded CSV/Excel)

Environment Sensing: Captures real-time social context including sentiment, topics, and consensus

Attitude Injection: Accepts natural-language attitude specifications for controllable generation

Controllable Posting: Auto-generates and publishes content matching cloned styles

Quick Start
Download the .exe from Releases, double-click, and follow the on-screen prompts. No installation or coding required.

